1 NAME Rasmus Henrik /Kruse/
2 GIVN Rasmus Henrik
2 _MARNM Kruse
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nautrup
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 AUG 1796
