1 NOTE
2 CONT October 24, 1974 - Mrs Elias (Julia) Bjorgo, 83, passed away Sunday afternoon, October 13th, 1974 at Tweeten Memorial Hospital after a lingering illness.  The former Julia Halverson, she was born in Allamakee County, Iowa October 
2 CONC 8, 1891, the daughter of Herman and Brynild Langlie Halvorson.  She married Elias Bjorgo at Waterloo Ridge in September 1910.  He died November 1, 1962.  She was a member of the Big Canoe Luthean Church and its women's organizatio
2 CONC ns.
2 CONT Survivors are: three sons, Roman, Minneapolia, Gilman, Decorah, Iowa and Lloyd, Spring Grove.  One brother and one sister have died. Funeral services were held at 2 p.m. Wednesday October 16th at the Big Canoe Lutheran Church, the
2 CONC  Rev. Emil Martinson officiated with burial in the church cemetery.
2 CONT Pallbearers were: Selmer Askelson, Charles Shuros, Jens Shuros, Bernard Shuros, Kenneth Sacquitine, Forrest Sacquitne
1 NOTE
