1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  https://danskefilm.dk/skuespiller.php?id=2339 Biografi Vibeke Steinthal, journalist, der var datter af domprovst Poul Christian Brodersen, ble den 21. maj 1959 gift i domprovstens hjem (Vor Frue sogn) med journali
2 CONC st Herbert Steinthal. Ægteskabet blev opløst i 1974.
2 CONT
2 CONT Vibeke Stenthal was born on April 1, 1931 as Vibeke Brodersen. She is known for her work on Roser og persille (1993), Tango for tre (1994) and Tro, håb og kærlighed (1984). She died on February 9, 2015. See full bio » Born: April 
2 CONC 1, 1931 Died: February 9, 2015 (age 83) http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0826707/?ref_=nmbio_bio_nm
