1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A very special grandmother.  I spent a lot of time with her while I was growing up and she was such a wonderful lady.  She always told me to never go to bed mad, always to be sure to say I love you, because you nev
2 CONC er knew what could happen and how bad you would feel if you hadn't had said those special words.  I still remember the summers Michael and I would spend with her and grandpa at their little farm in Lynnwood and what memories I hav
2 CONC e to cherish.  She has always had a very special place in my heart. I was truly blessed.  JoLynn
