2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hendrich bought the Fadnes farm from his father Ola in 1801 for 2 pd. 12mk.(?). Accommodation and support to the parents was provided by Hendrich. In 1837, Hendrich deeded the farm to his eldest son, Ole Henrikson Fadness, for 250
2 CONC  spd. In 1798 a son, Lars, was born to Hendrich and Barbraa Haldorsdotter, of the Horvei farm, apparently out of wedlock..
